  "body": "Here https://matrix.org/docs/guides/faq.html#how-do-i-get-an-account-and-get-started it says that to create an account:\r\n\r\n> The quickest way is to pick a client from https://matrix.org/blog/try-matrix-now and sign up.\r\n\r\nSo I chose one of the clients, tensor, https://github.com/davidar/tensor, and there is no obvious way to create an account there because it only asks for login/password.\r\n\r\nPlease update the instructions.\r\n",
